      "metadata": {
        "id": "fd03e0df"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Regressor coefficients and intercept\n",
        "\n",
        "Se muestran la pendiente/coefficient y el intercepto aprendidos por el modelo."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "e76e4230",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "e76e4230"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Regressor coefficients and intercept\n",
        "print(f'Coefficient: {regressor.coef_}')\n",
        "print(f'Intercept: {regressor.intercept_}')"
      ]
